---
description: Production go-live reminder
alwaysApply: true
---
When the user mentions production, launch, go live, release, app store, or tunetalez.com:
1. Before any production action, open docs/PRODUCTION_CHECKLIST.md, list the unchecked items in plain language, and mark which ones the user must do manually.
2. Do not run any production step that depends on an unchecked manual item. Ask first.
3. When the user confirms an item is done, tick it in the file and commit.
4. Whenever new production-only work comes up during development, add it to the checklist.
